Output agent-demo.mp4
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1180
Set Height 840
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Shell bash

Hide
Type "unset CLAUDE_CODE_CHILD_SESSION CLAUDECODE CLAUDE_CODE_ENTRYPOINT; clear"
Enter
Show
Type "claude"
Enter
Sleep 15s
Type "What's the worst product MKBHD has talked about on TikTok? Quote him."
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 175s
